	(379, NULL, 147, 'bot', 'I\'m still having trouble understanding. Could you try asking in a different way?', '2025-12-01 20:30:54', '2025-12-01 20:30:54'),
	(380, NULL, 147, 'employee', 'how are teachers promoted', '2025-12-01 20:31:27', '2025-12-01 20:31:27'),
	(381, NULL, 147, 'bot', 'Teaching personnel are re-ranked every 3 years, but earlier re-ranking may be requested if they pass board/licensure exams or earn graduate/postgraduate degrees. Faculty promotions follow the Academic Affairs and Basic Education Division guidelines, handled by the Rank and Tenure Committee and Promotion Board.', '2025-12-01 20:31:28', '2025-12-01 20:31:28'),
	(382, NULL, 147, 'employee', 'leave credits', '2025-12-01 20:32:06', '2025-12-01 20:32:06'),
	(383, NULL, 147, 'bot', 'Leave credits vary: College faculty have 2 vacation, 2 sick leave, and 1 emergency leave credits for each semester, Basic Education teachers have 4 vacation, 4 sick leave, and 2 emergency leave credits, while office and general services staff have 12.5  vacation, 3 sick leave, and 2 emergency leave credits per year.', '2025-12-01 20:32:07', '2025-12-01 20:32:07'),
	(384, NULL, 147, 'employee', 'how do i apply for leave', '2025-12-01 20:32:31', '2025-12-01 20:32:31'),
	(385, NULL, 147, 'bot', 'Leave of absence, with or without pay shall always be filed. Study leave must be requested in writing and approved by the Father President with endorsement from the division head. Unauthorized absences may result in deductions or disciplinary action."', '2025-12-01 20:32:33', '2025-12-01 20:32:33'),
	(386, NULL, 147, 'employee', 'benefits', '2025-12-01 20:33:03', '2025-12-01 20:33:03'),
	(387, NULL, 147, 'bot', 'Employees are entitled to vacation and sick leave. Emergency leave may be granted for serious accidents, natural calamities, or urgent personal matters. Faculty and staff may also request leave without pay for up to one year for health, studies, or other valid reasons.', '2025-12-01 20:33:04', '2025-12-01 20:33:04'),
	(388, NULL, 147, 'employee', 'How long is the probation period?', '2025-12-01 20:33:46', '2025-12-01 20:33:46'),
	(389, NULL, 147, 'bot', '"Newly hired employees undergo a 6-month probationary period. Their performance is evaluated before regularization. Those who meet expectations are given a Regular Employment Agreement; those who do not may be terminated."', '2025-12-01 20:33:48', '2025-12-01 20:33:48'),
	(390, NULL, 148, 'employee', 'What are the regular working hours?', '2025-12-01 20:56:39', '2025-12-01 20:56:39'),
